# The same clock propagated and derated. Through cb0 (positive-unate, rises slowly, falls fast)
# and then cb1 (non-unate, slew-dependent), a clock-pin transition reached from the rise edge and
# the same transition reached from the fall edge arrive at different times; each edge's launch,
# capture and CRPR take that edge's own clock path.
# OpenSTA (standalone 4af3c130), as above, each end alone:
#   setup n2/D 1.3940  r3/D 0.7911  y 1.4857  y3 1.3546
#   hold  n2/D -0.6500 r3/D -0.0507 y -0.7742 y3 -0.6662
design:      nonunate_clk
netlist:     nonunate_clk.v
lib:         nonunate_clk.lib
sdc:         nonunate_clk_prop.sdc
input_slew:  0.02
output_load: 0.005
